For many French people, Friday the 13th = GOOD luck 🍀🇫🇷

• vendredi treize = Friday the 13th
• la chance = luck
• bonne chance = good luck
• ça porte bonheur = it brings good luck
• la malchance = bad luck

💌 Save this for next time
👯 Send it to someone who needs good luck today

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

